---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import EmailCta from "../components/EmailCta.astro";
---

<Layout
	title="How to Buy — Authikey TPM Kits"
	description="Authikey TPM kits are sold by email, not online checkout. Tell us which kit you need (ASUS, Gigabyte, MSI or ASRock) and your country — we confirm compatibility and send a payment link. US$53 per kit."
>
	<section class="section">
		<div class="container">
			<h1>How to buy</h1>
			<p class="lede">
				<strong>We do not offer online checkout.</strong> All orders are placed by
				email. This lets us confirm your motherboard is actually compatible before
				you pay — most compatibility mistakes are caught at this step, not after
				shipping.
			</p>

			<div class="card price-card">
				<div class="price">US$53</div>
				<div>
					<strong>per kit, any brand</strong>
					<p>
						ASUS / Gigabyte / MSI / ASRock — same module, different adapter board.
						Shipping is quoted per destination in our reply.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>

			<h2>The four steps</h2>
			<ol class="flow">
				<li>
					<h3>1. Find your motherboard details</h3>
					<p>
						Note your motherboard's <strong>brand</strong> and <strong>exact model number</strong>
						— that's all we need to confirm compatibility for you. See
						<a href="/products/">Products &amp; Compatibility</a> for the supported list.
					</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<h3>2. Send us an email</h3>
					<p>Write to <a href="mailto:sales@authikey.com">sales@authikey.com</a> and include:</p>
					<ul>
						<li><strong>Your motherboard brand</strong> — ASUS, Gigabyte, MSI or ASRock</li>
						<li><strong>Your exact motherboard model number</strong> — so we can confirm compatibility</li>
						<li><strong>Your full shipping address</strong> — including recipient name and a contact phone number for the courier</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
				<li>
					<h3>3. We confirm and send a payment link</h3>
					<p>
						We verify compatibility, then reply with the total including shipping
						and a payment link (PayPal, in US dollars). Expect a reply within
						1–2 business days.
					</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<h3>4. We ship from Taipei</h3>
					<p>
						After payment we ship from Taipei, Taiwan with tracking. Express
						delivery is available on request for an additional fee.
					</p>
				</li>
			</ol>

			<div class="card">
				<h2>Copy-paste email template</h2>
				<pre>Subject: TPM kit order

Hi,

Motherboard brand: [ASUS / Gigabyte / MSI / ASRock]
Motherboard model number: [your exact model number]
Recipient name: [name for the parcel]
Shipping address: [full address, including postal code and country]
Contact phone (for courier): [your phone number]

Thanks!</pre>
			</div>

			<div class="card">
				<h2>Returns &amp; refunds</h2>
				<p>
					You may request a refund within <strong>30 days of delivery</strong>.
					Return shipping is at the buyer's expense; refunds are processed within
					two weeks of receiving the return. If we confirmed compatibility for your
					exact board model number and the module doesn't work on it, contact
					<a href="mailto:support@authikey.com">support@authikey.com</a> first — we'll sort it out.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="cta-block">
				<EmailCta subject="TPM kit order" />
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>

<style>
	h1 {
		font-size: 2.2rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}

	.price-card {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 1.5rem;
		margin: 1.8rem 0 2.5rem;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
	}

	.price {
		font-size: 2.4rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--accent);
		white-space: nowrap;
	}

	.price-card p {
		margin: 0.2rem 0 0;
		color: var(--text-muted);
	}

	.flow {
		list-style: none;
		padding: 0;
		margin: 1.2rem 0 2rem;
		display: grid;
		gap: 1rem;
	}

	.flow li {
		background: var(--surface);
		border: 1px solid var(--border);
		border-radius: 10px;
		padding: 1.2rem 1.4rem;
	}

	.flow h3 {
		margin: 0 0 0.4rem;
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		color: var(--accent);
	}

	.flow p, .flow ul {
		margin: 0.3rem 0;
		color: var(--text-muted);
	}

	.flow ul {
		padding-left: 1.2rem;
	}

	.card h2 {
		margin-top: 0;
		font-size: 1.2rem;
	}

	.card {
		margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
	}

	pre {
		background: var(--surface-2);
		border: 1px solid var(--border);
		border-radius: 8px;
		padding: 1rem 1.2rem;
		overflow-x: auto;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		line-height: 1.6;
		white-space: pre-wrap;
	}

	.cta-block {
		margin-top: 2.5rem;
	}
</style>
